<title>USA: Colorado Springs, Colo. $3.5 mln won by Wheat.</title>
<headline>Colorado Springs, Colo. $3.5 mln won by Wheat.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat, First Butcher Singer said it won $3.500 million of Colorado Springs, Colo., Taxable utilities system revenue bonds, Series 1996 B, with a true interest cost of 7.256 percent.</p>
